 game, Natural Hand Tracking,  Controller Free Catching challenge made for your hands. Watch the sticks, react to the drop and close your fingers to catch them. Build your timing across 50 levels with energetic music, encouraging spoken guidance and a lively virtual audience.\n\nChoose Adult with eight sticks or Kids with six compact foam sticks. Adjust stand height, width, stick length and falling weight to suit your reach. Explore ten stand styles and three destinations, or choose See my room to play with passthrough. Also Compatible with Meta VR Glasses.", "short_description": "Controller Free Catching challenge made for your hands. Watch the sticks, react to the drop and close your fingers to catch them. Build your timing across 50 levels with energetic music, encouraging spoken guidance and a lively virtual audience.\n\nChoose Adult with eight sticks or Kids with six compact foam sticks. Adjust stand height, width, stick length and falling weight to suit your reach. Explore ten stand styles and three destinations, or choose See my room to play with passthrough."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitizingtoday.com/games/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "digitizingtoday", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://digitizingtoday.com/games", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes":